tains to dominate land and sea. Conquer the monsters inhabiting the islands, expand your empire, and defend it from the British sailors!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/fbf419e681e825bf7182322235a44f63.poster.avif?t=1731009741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/fbf419e681e825bf7182322235a44f63.webm?t=1731009741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/fbf419e681e825bf7182322235a44f63.mp4?t=1731009741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>BUILD MIGHTY SHIPS &amp; DISCOVER THE RICHES OF UNDISCOVERED ISLANDS!</strong><br><br>Launch formidable fleets to rule the waves and transport your ambitions across oceans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/98ecccab8696021eac95e92aec7805cb.poster.avif?t=1731009741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/98ecccab8696021eac95e92aec7805cb.webm?t=1731009741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2371900/extras/98ecccab8696021eac95e92aec7805cb.mp4?t=1731009741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
